        "id": 1002746
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-25T00:41:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actions have priorities so a single action is not accurate with the spec. The matcher should parse the whole table then resolve. This should be clear in design.",
      "revId": "3451089e9146dc04a1dae9535ee3cce27a6ddeed",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e6183eb1_8eb8264a",
