        "id": 1002746
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-25T00:41:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Section 17.4 of IPMI spec requires a mandatory safety mechanism, in this case the startup delay to allow disabling the PEF action in case of filter misconfiguration. This would be addressed by implementing the complete mandatory commands.",
      "revId": "3451089e9146dc04a1dae9535ee3cce27a6ddeed",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
